WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.154
- Oh, hi Harper.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:11.809
What do, what is that?

00:00:14.843 --> 00:00:16.370
- Get down Mr. President!

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:19.724
(screaming)

00:00:21.635 --> 00:00:24.421
- This is actually a
Barefoot Contessa recipe,

00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:26.483
it took me three and a
half hours to make it.

00:00:27.857 --> 00:00:30.963
Cooking my food is like
actually kind of therapeutic.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.771
Oh wait, no, I'm doing it.

00:00:35.752 --> 00:00:36.710
- Last one dude.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.871
- Get down Mr. President!

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.038
(screaming)

00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:43.108
- Elliott, a vendor just
called up at the front desk,

00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:44.709
you wanna come join us on this one?

00:00:44.709 --> 00:00:45.606
- Okay.

00:00:46.749 --> 00:00:48.037
Is this a trap?

00:00:48.037 --> 00:00:50.894
- Elliott, it's a work phone call.

00:00:50.894 --> 00:00:52.305
Come on bud, let's go.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:57.448
- Okay, if this is the game,
I don't have health insurance.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:00:59.952
- I know, it's amazing actually.

00:01:00.502 --> 00:01:01.965
- Hi, this is Elliott speaking.

00:01:01.965 --> 00:01:04.079
- [Voiceover] Hey Elliott,
get down Mr. President.

00:01:04.079 --> 00:01:05.221
- Caylen?

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:07.705
It was a trap.

00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:09.620
- Get down Mr. President!

00:01:16.929 --> 00:01:21.929
(standoff music)

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.736
- I did it, I did it, I'm playing.

00:01:25.736 --> 00:01:26.699
- What's going on?

00:01:26.699 --> 00:01:27.809
Why aren't we working?

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.456
- Get down Mr. President!

00:01:32.724 --> 00:01:34.920
I actually sing Elton John songs

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.043
to my lunch after I make them,

00:01:37.043 --> 00:01:39.325
you can taste the love, it tastes better.

